---
<section class="hero tone-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="mono name">Fortune Max-Eguakun</h1>
    <p class="display headline" data-hero-headline>I make messy, live systems <em>boring to run</em>.</p>
    <p class="lede">Senior full-stack engineer. Breaking things since 2014, shipping them for a living since 2023. Right now I'm building the platform ~450 investors use to back startups.</p>
    <p class="mono cta"><a href="#work">See what I've shipped ↓</a> <a href="/contact">Say hi ↗</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .hero { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .name { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: var(--step--1); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .headline { font-size: var(--step-4); margin: 0 0 1.5rem; max-width: 14ch; }
  em { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); }
  .lede { max-width: 38rem; font-size: var(--step-1); color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 85%, var(--bg)); margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .cta a:first-child { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
